Subject: [PATCH] upower: build only libupower-glib on iOS

gnome-shell imports UPowerGlib at panel boot, but the UPower daemon and helper
tools are Linux-specific. Keep the D-Bus metadata and client library, and drop
the daemon, rules, docs, and tools for the iOS build.

diff -ruN upower-v1.90.2/meson.build upower-v1.90.2.patched/meson.build
--- upower-v1.90.2/meson.build	2024-02-13 12:02:22
+++ upower-v1.90.2.patched/meson.build	2026-07-04 23:18:00
@@ -111,14 +111,11 @@
 # Generate configuration file
 config_h = configure_file(output: 'config.h', configuration: cdata)
 
-subdir('etc')
-subdir('rules')
 subdir('po')
 subdir('dbus')
 subdir('libupower-glib')
-subdir('src')
-subdir('tools')
-subdir('doc')
+# iOS: ship only the client library. The daemon, tools, rules, docs, and
+# host service packaging require Linux udev/systemd/sysfs.
 
 pkgconfig = import('pkgconfig')
 pkgconfig.generate(
